  s5: Could not remove, student is still in
  s6: Host told it failed, but the student is an observer with the camera on
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the host presses Remove
  s0 --> s2: the host makes the student an observer
  s1 --> s3: the student is disconnected
  s1 --> s5: the removal fails after 100 tries
  s2 --> s4: the camera is stopped
  s2 --> s6: stopping the camera fails
